AxSpoofManager: keep the real device identity without GMS

The Play Integrity refresh stages a Pixel identity in persist.sys.pif.product.*,
and bionic serves it for ro.product.* reads in app processes. On this device
every app can read those props, so apps like Geekbench saw "Pixel 10 Pro XL".
Without com.google.android.gms there is nothing to spoof for: clear the staging
props and skip the refresh until GMS is installed.

